    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2445" root="بز" body-key="b">
    
      R. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَزْبَزَهُ</span></b> : see 1, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَزْبَزَةٌ</span>
[the inf. n.] also signifies The <i>being quick and
active in wrongful, unjust, injurious,</i> or <i>tyrannical, conduct:</i> and the rel. n. is ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَزْبَزِىٌّ</span></b> . (TA.)

